acement while giving B a space-allocation task and helpful trolley solution. Separate internal reread: fidelity 5, A3 and A5 explicitly celebrate restrictions as organizational reach; logic 5, B2's borrowed rooms cause distributed presence and B4's trolley causes mobile headquarters; relationship 4, B4 needs the desk and offers relocation help; heightening 4, A5 seeks visible departmental labels to enact expanded status; specificity 4, B2's meeting rooms and B4's files ground the generic office setting; brevity 4, A5's headquarters grows from the trolley rather than an unrelated flourish. Weighted total 90; all hard gates pass.\",\n      \"reservation\": \"A5's jurisdiction is A's inflated interpretation of coverage duties, not a newly established formal power. B's practical cooperation should keep the exchange from becoming sarcastic.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"exampleId\": \"D68-single-b\",\n      \"beforeHash\": \"bfb7f7a718c2bb8ebc95e89d7e5dc84c2e6017efbd164f95916fd09e2079225f\",\n      \"firstPass\": {\n        \"ratings\": {\n          \"cardFidelity\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"A1 clearly celebrates centrality, but A3's 'public engagement' and A5's discussion mandate do not clearly increase influence.\"},\n          \"responseLogic\": {\"score\": 4, \"evidence\": \"A3 recasts B2's personal complaints as engagement; A5 reinterprets B4's removal demand as interest in A's position.\"},\n          \"relationship\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"B2 and B4 communicate escalating dissatisfaction but have no defined role in handling the complaints.\"},\n          \"heightening\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"B4 raises the stakes to removal, but A5 offers a general mandate phrase rather than a larger or more specific influence claim.\"},\n          \"specificity\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"A1 establishes complaints, but B2 and B4 leave the organization, complainants and process unidentified.\"},\n          \"brevityWit\": {\"score\": 4, \"evidence\": \"A3's short 'Direct public engagement' follows B2 efficiently, while A5's mandate remains abstract.\"}\n        },\n        \"weightedTotal\": 66\n      },\n      \"beats\": [\n        {\"speaker\": \"A\", \"text\": \"Another customer complaint about me! I'm becoming the focus of this hotel.\"},\n        {\"speaker\": \"B\", \"text\": \"I'm taking you off reception while I investigate.\"},\n        {\"speaker\": \"A\", \"text\": \"Wonderful. Now management is organizing its day around me too.\"},\n        {\"speaker\": \"B\", \"text\": \"You'll answer every complaint in writing from the laundry office.\"},\n        {\"speaker\": \"A\", \"text\": \"My own correspondence operation, reaching into laundry. I'll need more paper.\"}\n      ],\n      \"decision\": \"revised\",\n      \"mechanism\": \"D68 turns each new restriction or burden into celebratory evidence of A's expanding influence.\",\n      \"confusableConcept\": \"A positive euphemism for criticism can save face without claiming that the criticism expands A's reach.\",\n      \"distinguishingEvidence\": \"Revised A3 treats removal from reception as control over management's attention, and A5 treats written complaints in laundry as a new organizational operation.\",\n      \"alternativeComparison\": \"Alternative b gives a hotel manager concrete disciplinary and work-allocation choices; alternative a uses a colleague's reports about budget and office losses.\",\n      \"reason\": \"Introduced a hotel and manager to make the complaint consequences playable. Separate internal reread: 5/5/4/4/5/4 = 92. B4's written-response duty and laundry location jointly cause A5's celebrated correspondence expansion.\",\n      \"reservation\": \"A5's expansion claim is intentionally disproportionate to a borrowed office; sincerity is essential to distinguish celebration from sarcasm.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"exampleId\": \"D69-single-a\",\n      \"beforeHash\": \"409d266ac16208001a1437243b1471123c3a3dfc7ba5e7399b27d41c5dcc54ed\